By crushing an alchemist gem you generate a thunderclap in a cone of radius [3, 4, 5, 7, 8 (TL1-5)] dealing [76, 103, 123, 141, 156 (TL1-5; SP 100)] physical damage and [76, 103, 123, 141, 156 (TL1-5; SP 100)] lightning damage.

All creatures caught inside are knocked back and disarmed for [5, 6, 7, 8, 8 (TL1-5; SP 100)] turns.

The duration and damage will increase with your Spellpower.
